[en.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR]
Sendak’s Secret Cooperator

[en.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR_desc]
Sendak and his cult claim to have found a way to eliminate Tirek. They need three to five years to collect the magic of the Kirins. In exchange, they will teach us dark magic to make up for our lost magic and provide us with economic assistance.
However, it is worth noting that in his plan manuscript, this time was originally ten years, but was later crossed out and changed to three to five years. What did they find? Or is this a conspiracy?

[en.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR_MODIFIER_TOOLTIP]
$C18_ADD_GROWTH_0_5_TOOLTIP$
We will receive $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ ×[?C18.VAR_MONTHLY_DEV_BONDS_FROM_SENDAK|Y0] from Sendak every month

[zh.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR]
僧达克的秘密伙伴

[zh.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR_desc]
僧达克和他的密教团声称已经找到了一个消灭提雷克的方法，他们需要三到五年的时间收集麒麟们的魔法，作为交换，他们将向我们传授黑魔法来弥补我们流失的魔力，并为我们提供经济援助。
然而值得注意的是，在他的计划手稿中，这个时间原本是十年，后来被划去，改为三到五年。他们发现了什么？又或者这是一场阴谋？

[zh.IDEA_C18_SENDAKS_SECRET_COOPERATOR_MODIFIER_TOOLTIP]
$C18_ADD_GROWTH_0_5_TOOLTIP$
我们将会每月获得来自僧达克的 $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ ×[?C18.VAR_MONTHLY_DEV_BONDS_FROM_SENDAK|Y0]
